@startuml
title SplitSmart expense lifecycle

[*] --> Draft : begin entry
Draft --> PendingReview : submit [valid fields and split]
Draft --> Draft : invalid input / correct
PendingReview --> PendingReview : approve [more stages remain]\n/ append decision, advance stage
PendingReview --> Approved : approve [final stage]\n/ atomic obligation posting
PendingReview --> Rejected : reject [authorized reviewer]\n/ append decision, no posting
Approved --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]

note right of PendingReview
No balance effect and no obligation entries.
Unauthorized, duplicate, or stale decisions do not change state.
end note
note right of Approved
Final approval and all distinct obligation postings are one logical,
transactional, idempotent operation.
end note
note bottom
Cancellation, edits, corrections, and resubmission are not specified; do not
infer transitions for them. Approval roles/self-approval/stage policy are open.
end note
@enduml
